      }
    },
    "Eagar gathers your calendars and deadlines into one brief, delivered at a natural break in your day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár gáthérs ýóúr çáléñdárs áñd déádlíñés íñtó óñé bríéf, délívéréd át á ñátúrál bréák íñ ýóúr dáý. ········································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eagar proposes college for calendars on an ncad.ie account and personal for the rest. Change any that are wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár própósés çóllégé fór çáléñdárs óñ áñ ñçád.íé áççóúñt áñd pérsóñál fór thé rést. Çháñgé áñý thát áré wróñg. ·············································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eagar reads only the name, email addresses and birthday of the people you choose, never their notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár réáds óñlý thé ñámé, émáíl áddréssés áñd bírthdáý óf thé péóplé ýóú çhóósé, ñévér théír ñótés. ········································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eagar reads your calendars to build your brief and find free time, and reads your reminder lists so you can mirror deadlines to them. It adds events and reminders only when you ask.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár réáds ýóúr çáléñdárs tó búíld ýóúr bríéf áñd fíñd fréé tímé, áñd réáds ýóúr rémíñdér lísts só ýóú çáñ mírrór déádlíñés tó thém. Ít ádds évéñts áñd rémíñdérs óñlý whéñ ýóú ásk. ········································································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eagar records a cancellation only when you confirm it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár réçórds á çáñçéllátíóñ óñlý whéñ ýóú çóñfírm ít. ······················]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eagar uses your own Claude API key for personal data you choose to send to Claude. College data never leaves your devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Éágár úsés ýóúr ówñ Çláúdé ÁPÍ kéý fór pérsóñál dátá ýóú çhóósé tó séñd tó Çláúdé. Çóllégé dátá ñévér léávés ýóúr dévíçés. ·················································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
