            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Íñ 1 hóúr ····]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Canvas, open Calendar and copy the Calendar Feed link. Anyone with the link can read your calendar, so it is kept in the Keychain. Assignment due dates become college deadlines.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Íñ Çáñvás, ópéñ Çáléñdár áñd çópý thé Çáléñdár Fééd líñk. Áñýóñé wíth thé líñk çáñ réád ýóúr çáléñdár, só ít ís képt íñ thé Kéýçháíñ. Ássígñméñt dúé dátés béçómé çóllégé déádlíñés. ········································································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In cdbooking, open your profile and copy your calendar feed and API token. Both are kept in the Keychain on this device. Loans stay on your devices and appear as college deadlines with return reminders 24 hours and 2 hours before they are due.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Íñ çdbóókíñg, ópéñ ýóúr prófílé áñd çópý ýóúr çáléñdár fééd áñd ÁPÍ tókéñ. Bóth áré képt íñ thé Kéýçháíñ óñ thís dévíçé. Lóáñs stáý óñ ýóúr dévíçés áñd áppéár ás çóllégé déádlíñés wíth rétúrñ rémíñdérs 24 hóúrs áñd 2 hóúrs béfóré théý áré dúé. ·································································································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include in brief": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Íñçlúdé íñ bríéf ······]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Input %@ and output %@ per million tokens": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Íñpút %@ áñd óútpút %@ pér míllíóñ tókéñs ················]"
