    "Weekly": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Wééklý ··]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Eagar": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Wélçómé tó Éágár ······]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, meetings with this person in college calendars count as contact. That information stays on this device and is never synced.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Whéñ óñ, méétíñgs wíth thís pérsóñ íñ çóllégé çáléñdárs çóúñt ás çóñtáçt. Thát íñfórmátíóñ stáýs óñ thís dévíçé áñd ís ñévér sýñçéd. ·····················································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where your data goes": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Whéré ýóúr dátá góés ········]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With no days chosen, any day works.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Wíth ñó dáýs çhóséñ, áñý dáý wórks. ··············]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a cancel page, Cancel opens your App Store subscriptions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Wíthóút á çáñçél págé, Çáñçél ópéñs ýóúr Ápp Stóré súbsçríptíóñs. ··························]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without an API token, Eagar reads the calendar feed only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Wíthóút áñ ÁPÍ tókéñ, Éágár réáds thé çáléñdár fééd óñlý. ·······················]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Wórkíñg ···]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yearly": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýéárlý ··]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yearly plans count a twelfth per month. Totals are per currency, without exchange rates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýéárlý pláñs çóúñt á twélfth pér móñth. Tótáls áré pér çúrréñçý, wíthóút éxçháñgé rátés. ···································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yes, I cancelled it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýés, Í çáñçélléd ít ········]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You choose what, if anything, goes to Claude.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóú çhóósé whát, íf áñýthíñg, góés tó Çláúdé. ··················]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will be asked to authenticate. The erasure itself is recorded in the ledger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóú wíll bé áskéd tó áúthéñtíçáté. Thé érásúré ítsélf ís réçórdéd íñ thé lédgér. ································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're busy when this is due.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóú'ré búsý whéñ thís ís dúé. ············]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Canvas items, their deadlines and the feed address are deleted from this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr Çáñvás ítéms, théír déádlíñés áñd thé fééd áddréss áré délétéd fróm thís dévíçé. ··································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first brief": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr fírst bríéf ······]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iCloud account changed, so syncing is paused. Your data is still on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr íÇlóúd áççóúñt çháñgéd, só sýñçíñg ís páúséd. Ýóúr dátá ís stíll óñ thís dévíçé. ··································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your key": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr kéý ···]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your loans, their deadlines and reminders, and the feed address and token are deleted from this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr lóáñs, théír déádlíñés áñd rémíñdérs, áñd thé fééd áddréss áñd tókéñ áré délétéd fróm thís dévíçé. ·········································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your morning brief arrives after 08:00, at the first natural break. You can change the times in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr mórñíñg bríéf árrívés áftér 08:00, át thé fírst ñátúrál bréák. Ýóú çáñ çháñgé thé tímés íñ Séttíñgs. ··········································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your next items, with college items shown as a count.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr ñéxt ítéms, wíth çóllégé ítéms shówñ ás á çóúñt. ·····················]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your notes sync between your devices end-to-end encrypted in iCloud. Eagar never reads contact notes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ga": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "[Ýóúr ñótés sýñç bétwééñ ýóúr dévíçés éñd-tó-éñd éñçrýptéd íñ íÇlóúd. Éágár ñévér réáds çóñtáçt ñótés. ········································]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
